BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Day of the Dead
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20261101
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20261102
DTSTAMP:20261012T202002Z
UID:433e5b7ddddffa43d12157b3@visitarizona-calendar
DESCRIPTION:Ballet Folkloric de Colores performs traditional dances in col
 orful\, vibrant\, time-honored costumes. One of Sedona’s favorite guitar
 ists\, Eric mesmerizes audiences with his mastery of flamenco\, Latin rhyt
 hms\, Brazilian sambas\, jazz and original compositions. An award-winning 
 all-women Mariachi group from Phoenix. Beautiful Mexican ballads and Neo F
 lamenco music\, kid’s activities and more.\n\nEvent website: https://www
 .tlaq.com/events\n\nVisit Arizona listing: https://www.visitarizona.com/ev
 ents/day-of-the-dead
LAST-MODIFIED:20261012T202002Z
LOCATION:TLAQUEPAQUE\, Arizona 179\, Sedona\, AZ\, USA
URL:https://www.visitarizona.com/events/day-of-the-dead
END:VEVENT
